  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIEm">III Em</ref> 7.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et praepositus vel tainus, comes vel villanus, qui hoc facere nolet aut disperdet, emendet CXX sol. et sit dignus eorum quae supra dicta sunt.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the reeve or the thegn, the noble or commoner who refused to do this, or disregards it, shall pay a fine of 120 shillings, and incur the penalties which have been stated above.</ab>
      </div>
